From f174d633791d55dcce0e4cb9d581eb74582c1c28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Laze ." <laze.@MacBook-Pro-50.local>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 01:01:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Expose semantic water faces to local Aurora material shaders

Keep the packed terrain vertex at 24 bytes and preserve its HDR tier. Accept the explicit experimental API 0.1-aurora-water.1 alongside the original API.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
---
