 crates/horizon-shader-api/src/stages.rs       |  4 +++-
 crates/horizon-shader-api/tests/schema.rs     |  7 ++++++
 docs/api/shaders-reference.md                 |  1 +
 8 files changed, 50 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

